      "disposition": "confirmation; re-verified by the primary: cargo metadata versioned sibling dev-deps [] after the change; preflight selftest 18/18 and 17/18 under the R6 mutation; the cycle reproduced by cargo publish --dry-run on aprender-core, aprender-graph and aprender-data",
      "agy_id": "cargo-publish-semantics",
